      {
        "id": 1778044,
        "title": "Fetch-A-Thon 3.0",
        "seo_url": "https://unstop.com/hackathons/fetch-a-thon-30-masters-union-school-of-business-1778044",
        "type": "hackathons",
        "subtype": "online_coding_challenge",
        "region": "offline",
        "status": "LIVE",
        "details": "<p><strong>Overview</strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Welcome to Fetch-A-Thon 3.0, a national-level AI Agent hackathon bringing together students, developers, innovators, startup enthusiasts, and AI enthusiasts from across India to explore the exciting world of Agentic AI and build intelligent, real-world AI Agent solutions.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Whether you're an experienced developer or just beginning your AI journey, this is your chance to LEARN. BUILD. COLLABORATE. INNOVATE.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The challenge is real. The possibilities are limitless. Are you ready?</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">WhatsApp group:&nbsp;</span><a href=\"https://chat.whatsapp.com/FAgowp2Sd4PApaXr6jqQyL?utm_source=chatgpt.com\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">https://chat.whatsapp.com/FAgowp2Sd4PApaXr6jqQyL</span></a></p>\n<p><strong>What Is Fetch-A-Thon 3.0?</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Fetch-A-Thon 3.0 is a hands-on national AI Agent challenge where participants explore how intelligent agents can understand user intent, interact with tools and services, coordinate with other agents, and perform meaningful tasks.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Get introduced to ASI and Agentverse, explore the possibilities of Agentic AI, and put your skills to the test by developing practical AI Agent solutions that address real-world problems.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Don't just build another chatbot. Think bigger. Build something that can actually DO something.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>What Awaits You?</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Explore AI Agents &amp; Agentic AI</strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Discover how AI is evolving beyond traditional chatbots into intelligent systems capable of reasoning, interacting with tools, coordinating workflows, and taking action.</span></p>\n<p><strong>Build with ASI &amp; Agentverse</strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Explore the ASI ecosystem and get hands-on with technologies that help you understand and build AI Agent-based solutions.</span></p>\n<p><strong>Solve a Real-World Challenge</strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Put your creativity and technical skills to work. Identify a meaningful problem, develop your approach, and transform your idea into a functional AI Agent.</span></p>\n<p><strong>Learn by Building</strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Design, develop, test, and refine your solution with your team. Experiment, iterate, troubleshoot, and turn your concepts into working prototypes.</span></p>\n<p><strong>Learn from Mentors</strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Get guidance, insights, and feedback to help you strengthen your ideas and improve your project throughout the building process.</span></p>\n<p><strong>Who Should Participate?</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">College student or aspiring developer</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Software developer or engineer</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">AI/ML enthusiast</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">AI Agent builder</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Startup founder or aspiring entrepreneur</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Open-source contributor</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Curious innovator excited about Agentic AI</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">No need to be an AI expert to get started! Bring your curiosity, creativity, willingness to learn, and passion for solving problems. The goal is to learn by building and push the boundaries of what you can create.</span></p>\n<p><strong>What Can You Build?</strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Think beyond conventional applications. Imagine AI Agents that can:</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Automate repetitive tasks and workflows.</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Help people make smarter, more informed decisions.</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Interact with tools, APIs, and digital services.</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Coordinate multiple tasks to solve complex problems.</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Deliver innovative solutions to everyday challenges.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">These are just starting points. Your imagination sets the direction. Your skills bring the idea to life.</span></p>\n<p><strong>Project Submission &amp; Results</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Participants will develop their AI Agent solutions and submit their projects for evaluation.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Final Results Announcement: 28 October 2026</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Build something meaningful, demonstrate what your solution can do, and show the world what's possible with Agentic AI!</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Fetch-A-Thon 3.0</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Learn. Build. Collaborate. Create.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The future isn't just intelligent. It's agentic. Let's build it together.</span></p>",
